{"id": "post-18989-11d32568", "body": "\nIn article <4rhdua$mdc@geraldo.cc.utexas.edu>, someone@somewhere.com\n(Anon) wrote:\n\n> In article <31DB4B99.5729@philly.infi.net>, ltodd@philly.infi.net says...\n> >\n> >Here's a few quotes from some sick subversives who advocate overthrowing \n> >the gov't.\n> >\n> >  \"Mankind are disposed to suffer, while evils are sufferable, rthan to \n> >right themselves by abolishing the forms to which they are accustomed. \n> >But when a long train of abuses and usurpations, pursuing invariable the \n> >same object, evinces a design to reduce them under absolute despotism, it \n> >is their right, it is their duty, to throw off such government...\"\n> >  --THE DECLARATION OF INDEPENDENCE\n> >\n> >  \"We therefore advocate a revolution against the industrial system.\" -- \n> > THE UNABOMBER MANIFESTO\n> \n> Now you really have gone over the bend.  Do you really think that that the \n> founders of this country are comparable to the Unabomber?\n\nWell, why not?  I could compare just about ANY 2 things. If somebody finds\nsome similarities I'd *like* for them to point them out. Perhaps I'll find\nsomthing to ponder there too.  You, OTOH, like to just sit back in your\nanonymous little chair, call us all losers, tell us what is good and what\nis crap, and feel all superior. While esposing the virtues of being\n\"productive\",  you aparently see nothing UNproductive  about a complete\n*waste* of time, that is everything you post in here. I know you enjoy it,\nI know you get a kick out of all the response you get, but if you're so\ndamned concerned about being such a fine upstanding PRODUCTIVE citizen,\nTHEN GO FUCKING DO IT!! What are you wating for? Go live your life and\nwe'll live ours. I guess I wouldn't have any problem with your posts in\nhere if you weren't being such a god damn hypocrite. Now......to address\nmy second sentance: I shall begin by comparing YOU to a turd. Stay tuned.\n\n-- \n������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n\"Beleive it if you need it, if you don't just pass it on\" - Grateful Dead\n������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������������\n\n\n\n", "matches": [{"start": 685, "end": 749, "paragraph": 4, "unit": "p4", "location": "inherited_quote"}], "headers": {"From": "bimmer88@bitstream.net", "Date": "1996/07/05", "Subject": "Re: On Overthrowing the Government", "Message-ID": "<bimmer88-0507962212250001@port10.bitstream.net>", "Newsgroups": "alt.fan.unabomber", "References": "<31DB4B99.5729@philly.infi.net> <4rhdua$mdc@geraldo.cc.utexas.edu>", "In-Reply-To": "", "Organization": "Ejecting Wizzards of Rythem"}, "category": "quotation_in_post"}